  "prefLabel": "Puc 502.04 Jurisdictional LPG system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 502.04 “Jurisdictional LPG system\" means:\n\n(1) A system involving a single source which serves 10 or more customers; or\n\n(2) A system where more than one customer is located in a public place.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 500) #13794, eff 10-25-23",
